# SELENE Sensor Validation Tests

This directory contains standalone test scripts used to validate the individual sensors before system integration.

## Test Scripts

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `test_max30102.py` | Tests red and infrared PPG data acquisition from the MAX30102 sensor. |
| `test_max30205.py` | Tests temperature readings from the MAX30205 sensor. |
| `test_veml7700.py` | Tests ambient light measurements and skin-contact detection using the VEML7700 sensor. |

## Running the Tests

Run each test script independently on the Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W using MicroPython.

The corresponding sensor driver must be available on the device.

These tests support individual sensor validation prior to full system integration.
